# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# SNOMED CT content is licence-gated and NEVER committed (.claude/rules/vendored-inputs.md).
# A licensed RF2 release brought into a working tree must not be committable by
# accident; widen this list in the same change if a genuinely new shape appears.
SnomedCT_*
Snapshot/
Full/
Delta/
*.rf2
sct2_*
der2_*
# The local, licensed RF2 release used for development lives under data/ and
# never leaves the machine.
/data/
# Built serving artifacts (tools/ferroterm-build output): redb store + fst/roaring indexes.
/artifacts/
*.redb
*.fst

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Claude Code personal/local overrides (never committed)
.claude/settings.local.json

# The image build context: binaries staged by the release lane, never committed.
/dist/
# The rendered book (mdbook build-dir); .github/workflows/docs.yml renders it.
/website/book/book/
# Benchmark records are taken over licensed data on the owner's machines and
# published from the records the owner commits by hand.
/bench/results/*.json
!/bench/results/.gitkeep
